</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Impact statement</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This paper presents work aimed at advancing the field of graph machine learning through the development of a graph foundation model for node classification. Potential applications of such models include social network analysis, recommendation systems, fraud detection, and knowledge graph completion. These applications can have significant societal impacts, ranging from improved information retrieval and decision support to risks such as bias amplification, privacy concerns, or the reinforcement of misinformation. However, we do not identify any specific, immediate concerns requiring special attention in the context of this work.</p>
</div>
</section>
